State 0

    0 $accept: • input $end

    TOK_USE     shift, and go to state 1
    TOK_SELECT  shift, and go to state 2
    TOK_INSERT  shift, and go to state 3
    TOK_UPDATE  shift, and go to state 4
    TOK_DELETE  shift, and go to state 5

    input        go to state 6
    statement    go to state 7
    use_stmt     go to state 8
    select_stmt  go to state 9
    insert_stmt  go to state 10
    update_stmt  go to state 11
    delete_stmt  go to state 12


